---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How to use this site | Pamana">
  <section class="guide">
    <h1>How to use this site</h1>
    <p>Start on the home page and choose the path that matches where you are: research, your own diagnosis, or supporting a loved one.</p>
    <p>On the patient hub, open the stage that best describes the situation. Each card leads to a focused article.</p>
    <p>Use the icons at the top right for newsletters, clinics, help, and accessibility options.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .guide {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
